s) floats near the center-right, adding a touch of cultural authenticity and visual warmth to the cool-toned composition. Dominating the upper third of the image are two large, bold calligraphic characters — “清明” (Qingming) — painted in flowing white brushstrokes with subtle ink bleed effects, giving them an organic, hand-painted feel. Below, smaller text reads “[清明·时节]” and “清明时节情谊浓，踏青祭祖念先人,” followed by the English translation “PURE BRIGHTNESS” in clean, minimalist sans-serif font.\n\nThe lighting is soft and directional, coming from behind the mountain peaks, casting long, gentle shadows across the valley floor while illuminating the mist with a heavenly radiance. The overall mood is one of peaceful reverence, quiet nostalgia, and natural harmony — a moment suspended between memory and presence, where nature and tradition intertwine under the whispering rain. Every element — from the texture of the buffalo’s wet hide to the ripples distorting the reflection — is rendered with meticulous attention to detail, inviting the viewer into a world both dreamlike and deeply real."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 31, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 103, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 24, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [28], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "size": [226.33966064453125, 88], "pos": [812.947998046875, 678.05908203125], "widgets_values": ["泛黄，发绿，模糊，低分辨率，低质量图像，扭曲的肢体，诡异的外观，丑陋，AI感，噪点，网格感，JPEG压缩条纹，异常的肢体，水印，乱码，意义不明的字符，泛蓝"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 22, "label